Package: oceancube
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Multidimensional Ocean Data Cubes
Version: 0.2.0.9000
Date: 2026-08-14
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Elmer",
           family = "Quispe-Salazar",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "qselmer@gmail.com")
Description: Represents multidimensional ocean data with a canonical
    longitude, latitude, depth, time, and variable contract. In-memory and
    read-only local 'NetCDF' backends support validation, inspection,
    selection, extraction, CF-aware time handling, temporal aggregation,
    climatologies, anomalies, descriptive per-cell temporal trends, bounded
    vertical diagnostics, and static scientific visualization. Polygon masks,
    grid geometry, and polygon weights support downstream marine analyses.
